Kalamis is a deep red, vaguely fragrant ink produced in [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/index|Athrea]]. The kalamis flower only grows on vines in the [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/Kettin Forests|Kettin Forests]] and is highly poisonous if not treated correctly. The expensive ink is highly sought after as a status symbol.
